WEBVTT

00:12.830 --> 00:14.730
Where are we going?

00:14.730 --> 00:16.190
Batabitjira.

00:16.190 --> 00:18.530
What?

00:18.530 --> 00:20.160
Where I was born!

00:36.760 --> 00:38.560
Are you watching, Komimasa?

00:38.560 --> 00:40.830
It's a grave of kajakunban leaves.

00:46.590 --> 00:48.900
This place is deserted.

00:48.900 --> 00:52.690
We were the last ones. Mai-mai scuppers are
the only ones left.

00:53.890 --> 00:55.210
Like this?

00:55.210 --> 00:57.550
Retract your elbow a bit. Good.

01:04.210 --> 01:06.550
I can't believe that was your first shot!

01:06.550 --> 01:09.830
I am Hunter Glen's sister, right?

01:09.830 --> 01:11.340
I'll get the furthest one.

01:14.280 --> 01:18.670
Don't go around telling people that
you're my sister around town, okay?

01:19.010 --> 01:22.340
Kajakunban leaves are tough!

01:26.980 --> 01:29.020
Hey, Iria...

01:29.540 --> 01:33.480
We'll get revenge for your
brother and Komimasa, right?

01:33.480 --> 01:34.450
Huh?

01:34.450 --> 01:35.740
I wanna be there, too.

01:35.940 --> 01:37.560
Kei...

01:39.650 --> 01:40.700
<i>— Iria.</i>
— What is it?

01:41.150 --> 01:44.190
<i>There’s a meeting with Dr. Touka
and the Administration tonight.</i>

01:44.190 --> 01:45.900
Can we sneak in?

01:45.900 --> 01:48.170
<i>Well, it’s a secret meeting.</i>

01:48.170 --> 01:51.800
You managed to find out about it, right?

01:51.800 --> 01:53.560
<i>I’ve got a couple of tricks up my sleeve.</i>

01:53.560 --> 01:55.730
I've got a few myself.

01:55.730 --> 01:58.190
We're heading back.

01:58.190 --> 02:00.040
What kind of trick are we talking about?

02:00.040 --> 02:01.730
Why do you need to know?

02:01.730 --> 02:02.890
You should know.

02:03.850 --> 02:05.310
What?

02:07.020 --> 02:08.480
Get back!

02:24.770 --> 02:26.730
All the way out here?

02:26.730 --> 02:28.670
Did it follow us?

02:28.670 --> 02:31.330
— We weren't followed.
— Then how?

02:33.740 --> 02:35.680
I don't know.

02:57.400 --> 03:04.680
<i>The night sky has betrayed the stars...</i>

03:07.910 --> 03:15.330
<i>A faraway cry slowly fades.</i>

03:18.380 --> 03:28.750
<i>The sun has disappeared...</i>

03:28.750 --> 03:38.810
<i>and my heart is alone
with the revelation.</i>

03:41.990 --> 03:49.890
<i>A stranger's dreams appear.</i>

03:52.460 --> 04:00.630
<i>Tempting lost souls.</i>

04:02.880 --> 04:10.750
<i>A stranger's dreams appear.</i>

04:08.890 --> 04:12.790
Iria: Zeiram the Animation

04:12.790 --> 04:15.770
Wind Song

04:38.710 --> 04:43.530
Then, his wife caught him
red-handed, and they had a huge fight.

04:43.530 --> 04:45.450
That's funny!

04:53.570 --> 04:57.750
Hey, lots of people went
missing around here recently.

04:57.750 --> 04:59.360
I-Is somebody there?

05:02.340 --> 05:03.690
What's that?

05:11.620 --> 05:15.460
This is a photograph of Zeiram
during the mayhem on Taowajan.

05:15.770 --> 05:17.420
Does it eat them?

05:17.420 --> 05:20.270
It's assimilating their cells.

05:20.270 --> 05:24.760
It seems to be necessary
for Zeiram's continued survival.

05:24.760 --> 05:30.610
So it's here in search of
more organisms to assimilate?

05:30.610 --> 05:36.070
Are you saying that it came
here of its own free will?

05:36.410 --> 05:38.390
Let me see!

05:38.390 --> 05:40.090
Why did you come along?

05:40.090 --> 05:41.990
Because I'm your partner!

05:41.990 --> 05:44.190
<i>Iria, there’s too much heat.</i>

05:44.190 --> 05:45.100
Shh!

05:45.100 --> 05:46.300
Pull out right now!

05:46.300 --> 05:47.240
Quiet!

05:47.470 --> 05:49.200
This is a joke.

05:49.200 --> 05:50.200
Where's the proof?

05:50.370 --> 05:52.400
I already told you!

05:52.400 --> 05:57.160
The monsters in Zaichi could've
been clones created by Zeiram!

05:57.440 --> 06:01.030
If he's on this planet,
it will be a disaster.

06:02.300 --> 06:06.720
There was a Zeiram fiasco just
recently, but it turned out to be a hoax.

06:06.890 --> 06:09.550
That's no concern of mine!

06:09.550 --> 06:14.180
I'm just saying that the recent
disappearances could be connected to Zeiram!

06:24.640 --> 06:28.210
If he's here, we can just
teleport him into space.

06:28.210 --> 06:31.780
He couldn't do much out there, I'm
sure.

06:31.980 --> 06:35.380
The administration will
adopt that course of action.

06:35.380 --> 06:38.750
Taowajan settled the
issue using the same plan.

06:38.750 --> 06:40.710
I say it didn't settle anything!

06:40.950 --> 06:42.920
It can survive under extreme conditions.

06:42.920 --> 06:47.490
It survived the explosion of the Karma.

06:47.490 --> 06:50.390
It crashed into Taowajan,
and ravaged the city.

06:50.390 --> 06:54.850
It was transported back into
space, and made it here, to Myce!

06:56.300 --> 07:00.810
Maybe he planned ahead and paid
for his teleport in advance!

07:02.040 --> 07:03.340
Say what you want!

07:03.340 --> 07:04.770
Ignorant imbeciles!

07:04.920 --> 07:05.810
Let's go.

07:05.810 --> 07:07.110
— Oh?
— Get moving!

07:21.620 --> 07:22.460
Who is it?

07:23.920 --> 07:24.920
Hi Gramps!

07:25.340 --> 07:27.880
You again? What is it this time?

07:27.880 --> 07:30.270
You know what we want.

07:30.270 --> 07:32.840
Do you think Zeiram's been
using the TransSat network?

07:33.190 --> 07:36.070
You were eavesdropping? You troublemakers!

07:36.070 --> 07:37.840
So?

07:37.840 --> 07:40.950
I don't think so.

07:40.950 --> 07:44.310
I don't know what
it's using to teleport.

07:44.630 --> 07:50.280
What if he assimilated a person
familiar with the network?

07:50.660 --> 07:52.340
What did you say?

07:54.000 --> 07:57.990
You said Zeiram assimilated my
brother's cells and created a clone.

07:57.990 --> 08:02.970
It's highly possible, but
it's still just a theory.

08:02.970 --> 08:05.540
How much of Glen
was assimilated?

08:05.540 --> 08:07.370
How should I know?

08:07.370 --> 08:10.270
We can make a clone from a fingertip.

08:10.270 --> 08:12.970
It doesn't need a complete body.

08:13.130 --> 08:16.300
Would a finger be enough
to copy his memories?

08:16.300 --> 08:18.360
His memories?

08:19.240 --> 08:20.220
What?

08:22.230 --> 08:24.190
What's happening?

08:32.220 --> 08:34.930
Listen, I think I hear something.

08:34.930 --> 08:36.170
Huh?

08:43.310 --> 08:44.460
What was that?

08:54.020 --> 08:59.300
Iria...

09:04.710 --> 09:07.470
Could they be responding to that noise?

09:08.190 --> 09:10.320
It sounds kind of sad...

09:11.120 --> 09:12.530
Glen...

09:12.800 --> 09:13.990
Hey, Iria!

09:15.360 --> 09:16.710
Wait for me!

09:16.710 --> 09:17.950
Later, gramps!

09:21.040 --> 09:22.620
Iria!

09:23.610 --> 09:26.260
What the hell!

09:27.150 --> 09:29.340
The noise stopped...

09:31.480 --> 09:34.340
<i>Iria, what’s wrong?</i> <i>Talk to me!</i>

09:34.600 --> 09:36.050
<i>Iria, what’s...</i>

09:37.010 --> 09:38.300
<i>I’m sure of it.</i>

09:38.300 --> 09:41.010
<i>Glen’s come back to me.</i>

10:19.240 --> 10:22.350
Glen, I'm right here.

10:23.450 --> 10:25.540
<i>Get away, as far as you can.</i>

10:25.540 --> 10:27.310
<i>Take care of yourself, all right?</i>

10:29.990 --> 10:31.230
<i>He dropped this...</i>

10:32.690 --> 10:35.760
<i>Iria...</i>

10:36.750 --> 10:39.740
You know what this place means to me.

10:42.510 --> 10:44.430
<i>All the way out here?</i>

10:44.430 --> 10:46.660
<i>Did it follow us?</i>

10:47.120 --> 10:48.610
Glen...

10:51.870 --> 10:53.530
I'm over here!

10:53.530 --> 10:55.590
<i>I'm over here!</i>

11:01.310 --> 11:03.050
You don't come when I want you to.

11:15.230 --> 11:15.940
Where's Iria?

11:16.510 --> 11:18.400
<i>No clue, she’s not back yet.</i>

11:18.810 --> 11:21.360
That was a dirty trick, Iria!

11:21.620 --> 11:22.960
<i>She’ll be back.</i>

11:22.960 --> 11:23.910
No, she won't!

11:23.910 --> 11:25.870
She went to get revenge on her own!

11:25.870 --> 11:26.720
<i>What!?</i>

11:26.720 --> 11:29.750
Iria's pissed off about
her brother's cells.

11:30.180 --> 11:32.500
<i>Her brother’s cells?</i> <i>You mean Glen’s?</i>

11:32.740 --> 11:33.740
Yup.

11:33.740 --> 11:36.560
She's gone nuts, taking off by herself...

11:36.560 --> 11:37.960
I can't believe she left without me!

12:25.040 --> 12:26.760
It's been three days!

12:26.760 --> 12:28.310
Still no contact from Iria...

12:28.310 --> 12:31.270
Don't worry, she'll be back.

12:31.550 --> 12:34.230
<i>Fujikuro, will you
help Kei look for her?</i>

12:34.230 --> 12:36.690
Why the heck do I have to help?

12:36.880 --> 12:40.150
She wants to fight Zeiram by herself.

12:40.150 --> 12:42.580
That's none of my business.

12:42.580 --> 12:45.650
I'm going to investigate
another serial murderer.

12:45.650 --> 12:48.370
Looking for Iria won't pay my bills.

12:48.660 --> 12:51.080
You jerk! Aren't you her friend?

12:51.080 --> 12:55.160
Whoa, don't get the wrong idea.

12:55.160 --> 12:59.040
I've never risked my
butt for friendship.

12:59.040 --> 13:01.510
Then why are you here?

13:01.710 --> 13:03.570
Shut up.

13:03.570 --> 13:06.700
Can't you link up to her? You're the expert.

13:06.700 --> 13:09.070
<i>She turned off her comm signal.</i>

13:09.070 --> 13:12.030
Then it's a lost cause. Give up.

13:12.030 --> 13:13.480
She'll come back.

13:14.710 --> 13:15.910
Fine!

13:15.910 --> 13:18.620
I don't need you, I'll go by myself!

13:18.620 --> 13:20.320
Go ahead.

13:20.320 --> 13:23.220
Bob, give this kid a weapon.

13:23.220 --> 13:25.120
A Borobdin or something...

13:25.120 --> 13:28.470
Wait, that was stolen.

13:30.990 --> 13:33.840
Now, where do you think you're going?

13:33.840 --> 13:35.960
Stay at home like a good little girl.

13:36.080 --> 13:37.420
— What?
— Huh?

13:37.760 --> 13:41.710
Keep this up and you'll
turn into another Iria!

13:41.710 --> 13:43.140
<i>A little girl?</i>

13:43.140 --> 13:45.380
— I mean Kei.
<i>— Is that true?</i>

13:45.580 --> 13:47.090
No, I'm not!

13:47.090 --> 13:48.750
Yes it is.

13:48.750 --> 13:51.500
I know a girl
when I smell one.

13:51.500 --> 13:52.280
<i>Kei?</i>

13:52.280 --> 13:54.220
It's none of your business.

13:54.220 --> 13:58.150
Are you gonna help me
look for Iria or what?

13:58.500 --> 13:59.960
<i>Come on, Fujikuro.</i>

13:59.960 --> 14:03.130
<i>She can’t handle this by herself.</i>

14:03.130 --> 14:04.840
<i>You know that.</i>

14:04.840 --> 14:09.840
When were you going to
reimburse me for my new Dempadan?

14:09.840 --> 14:13.120
My old one got trashed while
I was protecting Iria...

14:13.310 --> 14:15.080
<i>Fine! You win, okay?</i>

14:15.080 --> 14:18.040
Good, it's a deal!

14:51.220 --> 14:52.540
I don't understand.

14:52.540 --> 14:55.390
What's happening?

14:56.330 --> 14:57.730
Yes?

14:57.730 --> 15:00.460
I don't have time for this...

15:00.460 --> 15:03.530
What? How many times do I have to tell you?

15:04.960 --> 15:07.670
I said I don't have time!

15:07.670 --> 15:09.220
Never mind, I'll be right there!

15:10.480 --> 15:12.660
Can't you control this a bit better?

15:12.660 --> 15:16.180
Shut up! Get off if you don't like it.

15:16.570 --> 15:18.470
<i>Notice to all Hunters.</i>

15:18.470 --> 15:21.150
<i>We’ve spotted numerous Zeiramoid creatures.</i>

15:21.150 --> 15:22.960
Numerous what?

15:22.960 --> 15:25.740
<i>Location: Tanjekabaran Construction site.</i>

15:25.740 --> 15:31.100
<i>We also have information that Zeiram
is behind the recent disappearances.</i>

15:31.100 --> 15:32.420
<i>Move out.</i>

15:32.420 --> 15:33.990
— Let's go, Fujikuro.
<i>— I repeat...</i>

15:34.280 --> 15:36.950
Don't be ridiculous, I don't think so!

15:36.950 --> 15:39.090
Iria will be there!

15:39.090 --> 15:40.500
What?

15:41.460 --> 15:44.420
<i>Hear that, Fujikuro?</i> <i>Iria will be there!</i>

15:44.760 --> 15:49.000
Dammit, you both know where to find her.

15:49.000 --> 15:50.100
I'm outta here.

15:50.100 --> 15:51.070
Let's go!

15:51.070 --> 15:52.130
Hey, stop!

15:52.380 --> 15:53.740
What are you doing?

15:53.740 --> 15:54.960
Move it!

15:54.960 --> 15:57.100
I got it, I'll go!

15:57.310 --> 15:58.820
You brat!

15:58.820 --> 16:02.180
You're a lot worse than Iria.

16:14.320 --> 16:16.770
Satouragi Unit, meet up with Tonkuju.

16:14.630 --> 16:18.860
It’s pointless, they just keep coming!

16:16.770 --> 16:21.710
Send three men to the artillery.

16:18.860 --> 16:22.510
Myceans seems to be part of the group.

16:21.710 --> 16:25.130
Communication from Pandanjulk.

16:22.510 --> 16:24.560
Please advise!

16:24.560 --> 16:29.090
They are just getting back up!

16:25.370 --> 16:27.070
They're not actually Zeiram.

16:27.070 --> 16:29.090
They're Zeiramoid clones!

16:31.390 --> 16:33.440
Why are they here?

16:33.440 --> 16:35.780
How should I know?

16:35.780 --> 16:38.760
I just know that Zeiram
is part of that mob.

16:38.760 --> 16:42.600
Commander! It's too much for the TransSat network!

16:39.790 --> 16:42.600
Squad Jaranspichari needs back-up!

16:43.100 --> 16:44.920
We don't need transporters!

16:44.920 --> 16:46.290
Just stop them!

16:46.290 --> 16:47.440
Dr. Touka?

16:47.440 --> 16:49.900
I have to confirm something.

16:50.070 --> 16:53.490
The teleport staff is under
attack, we need more weapons!

16:58.530 --> 17:01.450
Fall back, maintain formation!

17:02.170 --> 17:05.780
Bujattein is falling, Squad Isumaal's down to ten!

17:02.750 --> 17:05.780
Surabaya is also falling back!

17:05.140 --> 17:05.840
Bujattein is falling, Squad Isumaal's down to ten!

17:05.780 --> 17:07.000
Just hold on!

17:08.460 --> 17:09.950
Ready, aim...

17:09.950 --> 17:10.750
Fire!

17:17.470 --> 17:19.430
March forward!

17:21.620 --> 17:22.930
They're coming!

17:28.070 --> 17:30.350
Shouldn't we be helping them?

17:30.350 --> 17:31.360
No, we're fine.

17:31.360 --> 17:33.100
No, we aren't!

17:33.100 --> 17:36.540
Komimasa and Glen need to be avenged!

17:36.540 --> 17:40.080
Shut up, you little punk.

17:40.670 --> 17:43.040
Take a look.

17:43.040 --> 17:45.580
Zeiram isn't down there.

17:45.580 --> 17:48.690
That means fighting right
now will be a waste of time.

17:48.690 --> 17:51.000
We'll wait until we spot Iria.

17:51.250 --> 17:52.750
This isn't working! Bullets
are useless against them!

17:52.750 --> 17:54.460
Keep them in that area!

17:54.760 --> 17:57.930
We have both Flamethrowers
and Madouradins en route.

17:58.280 --> 18:01.520
I hope the Madouradins don't
damage the surrounding area.

18:01.520 --> 18:02.770
We have no choice.

18:02.770 --> 18:05.580
What about the chief of
Tanjekabaran construction?

18:05.580 --> 18:08.020
I'll talk to him. Later.

18:08.230 --> 18:11.230
Flamethrowers and Madouras will be joining us soon! Hang in there!

18:26.660 --> 18:28.670
What is this?

18:28.790 --> 18:30.790
Fire!

18:39.670 --> 18:40.770
Yeah, all right!

18:40.770 --> 18:43.140
We should have used
this from the beginning.

18:45.410 --> 18:48.100
Looks like we won't
need the Madouradins.

18:48.310 --> 18:50.100
Advance!

18:54.220 --> 18:55.800
What in the world?

18:58.990 --> 18:59.950
What!?

19:06.590 --> 19:08.500
A Borobdin!

19:08.690 --> 19:10.600
That's our man, I'm sure of it.

19:10.600 --> 19:11.870
Okay, let's go!

19:11.870 --> 19:14.840
No, we haven't found Iria yet.

19:18.090 --> 19:19.810
We weren't informed about this!

19:19.810 --> 19:21.680
Where are the Madouras?

19:24.610 --> 19:27.120
That's Glen's Borobdin.

19:27.120 --> 19:29.600
So, Zeiram stole it...

19:33.610 --> 19:37.370
Wait, he didn't steal
it, he came back for it!

19:38.340 --> 19:39.320
What's wrong?

19:39.950 --> 19:41.770
That's Glen.

19:41.770 --> 19:43.280
Glen?

19:43.280 --> 19:44.770
I'm positive.

19:44.770 --> 19:48.790
Iria knows it, that's why she
wants to fight him by herself.

19:49.190 --> 19:51.620
Iria's brother is Zeiram?

19:54.790 --> 19:56.560
I'm lost.

19:56.560 --> 19:59.180
Glen turned into a monster!

19:59.180 --> 20:03.320
You're wrong! That means Iria has to
fight her own brother!

20:03.320 --> 20:05.030
Brother?

20:05.030 --> 20:08.510
I guess they were very close,
like brother and sister.

20:08.510 --> 20:09.560
Huh?

20:11.600 --> 20:13.520
Madouras are here! Let them pass!

20:32.640 --> 20:35.130
It’s useless, why isn’t this working?

20:33.490 --> 20:35.130
Switch the Madouras to manual control.

20:35.590 --> 20:38.030
Who can do that?

20:36.820 --> 20:38.840
What the hell is happening?

20:39.730 --> 20:40.920
This is...

20:52.260 --> 20:54.940
He's calling out for reinforcements!

20:55.350 --> 20:56.410
Pull back!

20:56.410 --> 20:59.880
We could hang on until
the Borobdin's tapped out!

20:59.880 --> 21:02.320
It should be out already!

21:06.320 --> 21:08.780
Pull back!

21:15.040 --> 21:16.130
Oh my God!

21:16.130 --> 21:18.410
It's a mess down there!

21:18.410 --> 21:20.510
Where the hell is Iria?

21:20.510 --> 21:21.840
I have no clue!

21:22.380 --> 21:25.230
Why is the Pujattiin still empty?

21:25.230 --> 21:26.800
Give it coverage from the rear!

21:26.800 --> 21:28.760
The Madouras should be there by now!

21:29.380 --> 21:30.180
What the...

21:32.520 --> 21:33.980
The Madouradins...

21:42.110 --> 21:44.590
I can't watch this. Let's go!

21:44.590 --> 21:45.760
Stop!

21:45.760 --> 21:48.340
What are you gonna do about it?

21:54.450 --> 21:56.160
— Iria?
— Yeah!

22:04.250 --> 22:06.420
Glen, I'm over here!

22:10.970 --> 22:12.620
We gotta go, Fujikuro!

22:12.620 --> 22:13.720
Why should we?

22:13.720 --> 22:16.560
Are you gonna let Iria fight by
herself?

22:16.560 --> 22:18.720
She can fight all she wants.

22:18.720 --> 22:21.220
I'm just here to help you look for her.

22:21.220 --> 22:23.020
Now that we found her, I'm leaving!

22:23.020 --> 22:24.730
You coward!

22:50.010 --> 22:52.430
You're still a damned good shot.

24:15.880 --> 24:19.600
Iria...

24:30.540 --> 24:32.070
Glen!

24:34.720 --> 24:35.950
Shoot me.

24:39.280 --> 24:42.000
I said, shoot me!

24:47.680 --> 24:49.180
Do it!

24:52.820 --> 24:54.430
Shoot!

24:54.430 --> 24:56.000
No...

24:56.000 --> 24:57.890
I will save you!

24:58.240 --> 25:00.190
You can't...

25:00.190 --> 25:04.850
You can't put me back together...

25:05.270 --> 25:06.810
No!

25:07.240 --> 25:11.040
Hurry, before my strength...

25:12.000 --> 25:13.440
Glen!

25:19.250 --> 25:20.160
Hurry!

25:22.120 --> 25:24.180
Now!

25:29.040 --> 25:30.960
Just shoot me!

25:45.690 --> 25:47.150
You!

25:48.370 --> 25:49.400
Because of you...

25:57.760 --> 25:58.780
Rot in hell!

26:14.590 --> 26:15.490
Iria!

26:15.490 --> 26:16.900
Iria, are you okay?

26:16.900 --> 26:18.860
Hey, don't move.

26:18.860 --> 26:21.850
She's not gonna die so easily, okay? So chill out!

26:22.310 --> 26:23.750
Kei...

26:23.750 --> 26:25.510
Fujikuro...

26:35.740 --> 26:40.780
<i>The morning to come
does not matter...</i>

26:40.780 --> 26:48.240
<i>let's go as we are now.</i>

26:53.990 --> 27:00.340
<i>We're passing a blue star...</i>

27:00.340 --> 27:06.450
<i>a tiny floating light.</i>

27:06.450 --> 27:12.850
<i>It's just the two
of us, no need to speak.</i>

27:12.850 --> 27:18.680
<i>Looking out over the city...</i>

27:18.680 --> 27:24.890
<i>The painful memories we have shared...</i>

27:24.890 --> 27:30.170
<i>they will be put to rest tonight.</i>

27:30.170 --> 27:36.790
<i>And the night to come
does not matter...</i>

27:36.790 --> 27:44.000
<i>let's go without looking back.</i>

27:44.000 --> 27:49.280
<i>Even though our dreams are far away...</i>

27:49.280 --> 27:56.640
<i>I will never let them go.</i>

28:10.300 --> 28:13.420
The pain crushes the
heart of the injured Iria.

28:14.200 --> 28:17.630
The landscape bears no
resemblance to the city it once was.

28:17.630 --> 28:22.880
A small determination changes
memories deep inside the heart.

28:23.050 --> 28:29.180
The monster pulls everything
into the darkness before dawn.

28:29.180 --> 28:31.060
You were just like me...

28:31.360 --> 28:35.230
Zeiram, I'm here to
put an end to this hell!

28:35.230 --> 28:39.400
Utopia.
